text I head to the library right after morning classes end.
text Maybe, just maybe... Kotomi might be there.
text She might be waiting for me with half of her lunch left over.
text That's what I tell myself.
text I slowly go to open the usual sliding door.
text It's locked.
text The air of the empty hallway feels alien to me.
text How long have I been standing here?
